{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 22862, "game_id": 202, "entry_id": 21945, "uid": 25162, "type": 4, "title": "【日服】还魂推荐", "tag": "0", "created_at": 1579197769, "updated_at": 1596002435, "updated_uid": 0, "comment_at": 1596002435, "last_at": 0, "comment_count": 2, "status": 1, "summary": "大家好，我是玛维影歌。日服还魂已经实装一年多了，国际服刚刚实装还魂，我蹭一波热度，写一篇日服还魂推荐。话说在前面，还魂有主观性，如果你有己见，可无视本文。本文会从三个角度探讨值得还魂的天子。分别为：主", "thumb": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1586795791657_15779178.jpg", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 6, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 19668, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 0, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 0, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 22862, "content": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\" data-reset=\"true\">大家好，我是 玛维 影歌。日服还魂已经实装一年多了，国际服刚刚实装还魂，我蹭一波热度，写一篇日服还魂推荐。话说在前面，还魂有主观性，如果你有己见，可无视本文。<span lang=\"EN-US\" data-reset=\"true\"><span data-reset=\"true\"></span></span></p><span data-reset=\"true\">\n\n</span><p class=\"MsoNormal\" data-reset=\"true\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" data-reset=\"true\"><span data-reset=\"true\">&nbsp;</span></span></p><span data-reset=\"true\">\n\n</span><p class=\"MsoNormal\" data-reset=\"true\">本文会从三个角度探讨值得还魂的天子。分别为：主观、赌博、短期。日服的还魂材料非常精贵，如果无氪，大概每隔两个月能还魂<span lang=\"EN-US\" data-reset=\"true\">3</span>次，每氪一次<span lang=\"EN-US\" data-reset=\"true\">DEVILPASS</span>可以多一次还魂机会。请大家务必珍惜每次还魂。<span lang=\"EN-US\" data-reset=\"true\"><span data-reset=\"true\"></span></span></p><span data-reset=\"true\">\n\n</span><p class=\"MsoNormal\" data-reset=\"true\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" data-reset=\"true\"><span data-reset=\"true\">&nbsp;</span></span></p><span data-reset=\"true\">\n\n</span><p class=\"MsoNormal\" data-reset=\"true\">主观推荐：还魂需要保值，还魂后高概率被遗弃的天子不推荐还魂。优先选择上场频率高的天子。什么天子保值？辅助、妨害。万用辅助<span lang=\"EN-US\" data-reset=\"true\">N</span>莫娜、海王星。万用妨害巴托丽。这仨我想不用多说。接下来会出现分歧，优先<span lang=\"EN-US\" data-reset=\"true\">RAID? WORLDBOSS? DEVILRUMBLE?</span>个人建议先WB。<span lang=\"EN-US\" data-reset=\"true\">WB</span>每隔两个月开一次，只要还魂，就一定会用到。<span lang=\"EN-US\" data-reset=\"true\">RAID</span>的问题在于并不能提前预测属性，运营还会故意设置各种障碍刁难你，给你还魂的天子设一道坎，强推新天子。不推荐还魂<span lang=\"EN-US\" data-reset=\"true\">DR</span>，因为日服<span lang=\"EN-US\" data-reset=\"true\">DR</span>收益低、更新快。——还魂<span lang=\"EN-US\" data-reset=\"true\">WB</span>，还魂哪些？木人鱼、光月月、<span lang=\"EN-US\" data-reset=\"true\">S</span>莫娜、糖果猫。<span lang=\"EN-US\" data-reset=\"true\">WB</span>常驻，非常保值。<span data-reset=\"true\"><span data-reset=\"true\"><strike>其它有一些见仁见智的，仓鼠、莎乐美。仓鼠单独给木系加速，配合木人鱼增加木系浓度强化【强殖】效果。莎乐美是泳圈、伊芙上位，<span lang=\"EN-US\" data-reset=\"true\">P</span>她代价高，除了提升她本身以外，还废弃了伊芙的价值。如果<span lang=\"EN-US\" data-reset=\"true\">7</span>位都已还魂完毕。</strike></span></span>剩下的选择较多。花妹、花奶<span data-reset=\"true\"><span data-reset=\"true\"><strike>、相机</strike></span></span>等，相对通用。除此之外，一种好方法是，留出一周期花（<span lang=\"EN-US\" data-reset=\"true\">2</span>、<span lang=\"EN-US\" data-reset=\"true\">3</span>朵），等开活动，还魂本次活动用到的属性对策，高收益，无风险。<b style=\"font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-weight: bold;\">2020年4月14日更新</b><b data-reset=\"true\" style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: bold;\">：增加黑仆猫、白仆猫。移除相机、莎乐美、栗鼠。</b></p><span data-reset=\"true\">\n\n</span><p class=\"MsoNormal\" data-reset=\"true\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" data-reset=\"true\"><span data-reset=\"true\">&nbsp;</span></span></p><span data-reset=\"true\">\n\n</span><p class=\"MsoNormal\" data-reset=\"true\">赌博玩家：有一类玩家，优先还魂刀。铁打辅助流水刀。还魂刀是一种赌博，刀必须针对属性才有价值。但是一旦针对到，就能打出成吨的伤害，<span lang=\"EN-US\" data-reset=\"true\">RAID</span>冲进前百不是梦。<span lang=\"EN-US\" data-reset=\"true\">RAID</span>属性辅、<span lang=\"EN-US\" data-reset=\"true\">WB</span>刀、<span lang=\"EN-US\" data-reset=\"true\">WB</span>属性辅 次之。收益不如<span lang=\"EN-US\" data-reset=\"true\">RAID</span>刀。但同样还魂一次，收益超过通用妨、辅。赌博玩家可自我权衡收益。<span lang=\"EN-US\" data-reset=\"true\"><span data-reset=\"true\"></span></span></p><span data-reset=\"true\">\n\n</span><p class=\"MsoNormal\" data-reset=\"true\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" data-reset=\"true\"><span data-reset=\"true\">&nbsp;</span></span></p><span data-reset=\"true\">\n\n</span><p class=\"MsoNormal\" data-reset=\"true\">短期玩家：没有耐心，经常不到半年就换游戏的人。如果你有这个习惯。那么，所有的强势角色不管是否常驻，都可以还魂。<span lang=\"EN-US\" data-reset=\"true\">P</span>一位常驻平均花上七八个月。嫦娥、泡面、复活奶、水炮、球哥，这些并非不可。或者像上面提到的，开活动，还魂本次活动用的上的角色。<span lang=\"EN-US\" data-reset=\"true\">DC</span>是一个月一次大活动。周期不长不短。请视情况谨慎决定。<span lang=\"EN-US\" data-reset=\"true\"><span data-reset=\"true\"></span></span></p><span data-reset=\"true\">\n\n</span><p class=\"MsoNormal\" data-reset=\"true\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" data-reset=\"true\"><span data-reset=\"true\">&nbsp;</span></span></p><span data-reset=\"true\">\n\n</span><p class=\"MsoNormal\" data-reset=\"true\">最后祝大家抽到自己想要的卡，还魂到想要优先还魂的天子。</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" data-reset=\"true\"><br data-reset=\"true\"></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" data-reset=\"true\"></p><div data-reset=\"true\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1586795791657_15779178.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1586795791657_15779178.jpg\" data-reset=\"true\" alt=\"【日服】还魂推荐\"></div><span data-reset=\"true\" style=\"font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><div data-reset=\"true\" style=\"text-align: right;\"><span data-reset=\"true\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 14px;\">2020年4月14日更新</span></div></span><p data-reset=\"true\"></p><br data-reset=\"true\"><p data-reset=\"true\"></p><p data-reset=\"true\"></p><div class=\"last-min-wrapper\" style=\"min-height:1px\" data-reset=\"true\"></div><br data-reset=\"true\">", "content_json": "", "content_cdn": "", "is_favorite": 0, "is_like": 0, "is_unlike": 0, "thumb_list": ["//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1586795791657_15779178.jpg"], "model_list": [], "user": {"uid": 25162, "username": "初月炭", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/5.png", "description": "NGA ID 玛维 影歌", "follow_num": 25, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 2, "is_super": false, "status": 1, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 2, "content_at": 0, "content_num": 12, "read_num": 330343, "like_num": 145}, "update_user": {"uid": 0, "username": "", "avatar": "", "description": "", "follow_num": 0, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 0, "is_super": false, "status": 0, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 0, "content_at": 0, "content_num": 0, "read_num": 0, "like_num": 0}, "game": {"id": 202, "name": "天命之子", "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1600339074877_54241879.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250", "alias": "dc", "content_count": 7758, "follow_count": 14519}, "themes": null, "seo_format": {"title": "", "desc": "", "key": ""}, "video_format": {"cover": "", "video": "", "width": "", "height": "", "duration": 0, "video_compressed": ""}, "contributor": null, "vote_list": null, "ban_image_list": null, "is_strategy": false, "is_strategy_v1": false, "entry_data_bind": null, "entry_data_bind_cdn": "", "emoji": [{"id": 6, "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_676/h_676/215/236746/2025/11/15/332900.png", "count": 0, "is_like": false}, {"id": 4, "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_676/h_676/215/236746/2025/11/15/652839.png", "count": 0, "is_like": false}, {"id": 3, "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_676/h_676/215/236746/2025/11/15/36968.png", "count": 0, "is_like": false}, {"id": 12, "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_676/h_676/215/236746/2025/11/15/862842.png", "count": 0, "is_like": false}], "reward": {"u